# Answer directories and working trees the seeds build in $HOME. They should
# never appear here, but they do when someone runs a seed from inside a clone.
answers*/
exam[0-9]*/
dist/
*.tgz
cka-helm/
cka-helm2/

# Recordings. These are BUILD OUTPUT — 'demo/record-demo.sh' regenerates them
# from the script it carries, and a committed GIF goes stale silently: the one
# that shipped through 1.x still showed 'exam3' and 'q3 2' long after those
# stopped being the documented commands, which is a worse README than no demo
# at all. If you want one in the README, record it and attach it to the
# release rather than committing the binary.
demo/out/

# Local editor/agent settings, not project config.
.claude/

# FUSE leftovers from editing files that were open elsewhere.
.fuse_hidden*
